  "details": "It's been an incredibly long amount of time and I think it's about time that VRChat releases itself to macOS. As Windows continues to die and other operating systems, including macOS, grow, VRChat should no longer cater solely to the monopoly. In addition, I know that VRChat is available for iOS and iPadOS, which run on the same architecture as current Macs, so I don't see lots of technical boundaries there, unless I'm missing something.",
